                                                "text": "1991, Theresa P. Gladden, Romancing Susan, Bantam Books, →ISBN, page 37,\n[…] she walked over to the table and switched off the Walkman as she sat down.\n“Hey!” Nikki yelped. “That was a stinky thing to do. That was my favorite song.”"
                                            },
