                                                "sense_id": "b4d1938e-3e10-36ff-bb96-8abdc90f870e",
                                                "text": "2007, Aletha V. Smithson, “Pacifier Breaking” (poem), in As He Was Known, AuthorHouse, →ISBN, page 172,\nThe binky drifted up and far away,\nTo the man in the moon, I heard them say;\nA cute idea but a rotten stinky plan."
